    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/1996-11-28/1996#art_75> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/1996-11-28/1996#art_75_para_0> a dzdoc:Paragraph ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/1996-11-28/1996#art_75> ;
    dzdoc:position 0 ;
