    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/1996-11-28/1996#art_90> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/1996-11-28/1996#art_90_condition_0_199d4698_activity_99d36b0f44> a dznorm:Activity ;
